            "heading_font_class": "fs-heading-4-base",
            "text": "<p>Wax dripping onto tablecloths or floors isn’t just messy—it’s distracting. That’s why Kisco’s pillar candles are crafted to burn cleanly, ensuring your surfaces stay pristine. Their drip-free design adds a layer of reliability, whether they’re used at a formal ceremony or in a retail display.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100",
            "text_max_width": 100,
            "link": "",
            "link_text": "",
            "button_style": "btn--primary"
          }
        },
        "column_xqxMq3": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "accent": "",
            "heading": "A Long Burn for Long-Lasting Impact",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "heading_font_class": "fs-heading-4-base",
            "text": "<p>Kisco’s bulk pillar candles are built to last, offering hours of steady, reliable light. For events that stretch into the night or church services where candles are central to tradition, this long-lasting burn ensures you won’t be left scrambling for replacements.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100",
            "text_max_width": 100,
            "link": "",
            "link_text": "",
            "button_style": "btn--primary"
          }
        },
        "column_MFfABt": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "accent": "",
            "heading": "Bulk Options for Large-Scale Use",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "heading_font_class": "fs-heading-4-base",
            "text": "<p>With options in a variety of sizes and unscented finishes, these pillar candles are designed to meet the demands of professional buyers. Whether you’re stocking shelves, hosting an event, or preparing for regular ceremonies, the flexibility and quality of these candles make them a standout choice.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100",
            "text_max_width": 100,
            "link": "",
            "link_text": "",
            "button_style": "btn--primary"
          }
        }
      },
