    "custom_liquid_9aNKBA": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "name": "t:sections.custom_liquid.presets.name",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n  \"mainEntity\": [{\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n    \"name\": \"What makes Kisco’s pillar candles ideal for churches and events?\",\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n      \"text\": \"Kisco’s pillar candles are dripless, unscented, and long-burning, making them perfect for creating a clean, peaceful ambiance during church services, weddings, and formal gatherings. Their elegant design fits seamlessly into any setting, while their reliability ensures they’ll last throughout your event.\"\n    }\n  },{\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n    \"name\": \"Can I customize bulk orders with specific sizes or colors?\",\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n      \"text\": \"Yes, Kisco offers flexibility when ordering in bulk. Choose from a variety of sizes and colors to match the specific needs of your event, ceremony, or retail offering. Contact our team for special requests or assistance with customization.\"\n    }\n  },{\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n    \"name\": \"Are the pillar candles made for extended use?\",\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n      \"text\": \"Absolutely. Our wholesale bulk pillar candles are crafted to provide hours of consistent burn time, making them an excellent choice for events or services that run long. Their steady glow ensures you won’t need frequent replacements.\"\n    }\n  },{\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n    \"name\": \"How do I access Kisco’s wholesale pricing?\",\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n      \"text\": \"To access wholesale pricing, sign up through our easy-to-use wholesale portal. Once registered, you’ll have access to exclusive bulk discounts, flexible order options, and dedicated support to meet your specific needs.\"\n    }\n  }]\n}\n</script>",
        "divider_style": "none",
        "section_padding": "section--vertical-padding-top-bottom"
      }
    },
    "rich_text_p7D8ce": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_MrGjAB": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Frequently Asked Questions About Wholesale Bulk Pillar Candles",
            "heading_tag": "h2",
            "heading_font_class": "fs-heading-2-base"
          }
        },
        "text_phgQQw": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Have questions about Kisco’s wholesale bulk pillar candles? Here are the answers you need to make an informed purchase decision.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100"
          }
        },
        "border_JMAjFR": {
          "type": "border",
          "settings": {}
        },
        "subheading_jRWLhL": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "What sizes do your bulk pillar candles come in?",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-6-base"
          }
        },
        "text_cVFhCr": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We offer bulk pillar candles in several widths and height combinations so you can match the candle to the scale of the display. Our assortment includes 2-inch, 2.25-inch, 2.75-inch, and 3-inch wide options, along with mixed-height sets for layered arrangements.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        },
        "spacer_zMPG6w": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 12
          }
        },
        "subheading_fVaWkq": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "What colors are available in your bulk pillar candle collection?",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-5-base"
          }
        },
        "text_xVMDY7": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>White and ivory are our main pillar candle colors. These are the two shades most customers choose for weddings, churches, restaurants, memorial settings, and classic event décor because they work with a wide range of palettes and presentation styles.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        },
        "spacer_HJbhYP": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 12
          }
        },
        "subheading_63Jihh": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "How do I choose the right pillar candle size for my event?",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-5-base"
          }
        },
        "text_dttHE3": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Choose smaller pillar sizes for tighter tables, grouped accents, and compact décor, and larger pillars for statement centerpieces, ceremony styling, and more open spaces. Mixed-height groupings are often the best choice when you want the arrangement to feel fuller and more intentional.<br/><br/></p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        },
        "spacer_arCY9p": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 12
          }
        },
        "subheading_q7RzEY": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Are pillar candles a good fit for weddings and formal events?",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-5-base"
          }
        },
        "text_BpeEzb": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Yes. Pillar candles are one of the most versatile choices for weddings and formal events because they add height, warmth, and visual structure without taking over the table. They work especially well in centerpieces, entry displays, ceremony décor, and reception styling.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        },
        "spacer_E94XKN": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 12
          }
        },
        "subheading_y7jTEQ": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Do your pillar candles work well in churches and religious spaces?",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-5-base"
          }
        },
        "text_VjY9cW": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Yes. Pillar candles are a strong option for churches, chapels, and devotional spaces because they offer a classic shape and a longer burn than smaller candle formats. They are also easy to arrange in pairs or grouped sets for altars, services, and ceremonial displays.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        },
        "spacer_wnT4jU": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 12
          }
        },
        "subheading_LfzFVm": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Can I use bulk pillar candles in restaurants and hospitality settings?",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-5-base"
          }
        },
        "text_zkPxAB": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Yes. Restaurants and hospitality spaces often use pillar candles for host stands, dining tables, event rooms, and lounge areas because the format looks polished and has more presence than smaller candles. They are a dependable choice when the candle needs to read clearly in a larger room.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        },
        "spacer_dpJLra": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 12
          }
        },
        "subheading_3yPTCQ": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Are your bulk pillar candles made for longer events?",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-5-base"
          }
        },
        "text_QqwxkW": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Yes. Pillar candles are a smart choice for events and services that run for several hours because their shape and wax volume support longer use. They are especially useful for receptions, dinners, churches, and venues that need a candle format with more staying power.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        },
        "spacer_P4JjwK": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 12
          }
        },
        "subheading_fKJQXR": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Can I mix different pillar sizes in one order?",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-5-base"
          }
        },
        "text_UrTxfD": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Yes. Mixing pillar sizes is one of the easiest ways to build depth into a centerpiece or display. Many customers combine more than one height so the arrangement feels layered and finished while still keeping the same overall color story.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        },
        "spacer_kp8Eif": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 12
          }
        },
        "subheading_X4XdyL": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "What is the best way to style pillar candles for a centerpiece?",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-5-base"
          }
        },
        "text_K3mMrc": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Use a mix of heights and keep the color palette consistent. Grouping pillar candles in twos or threes on trays, risers, or sturdy holders usually creates a cleaner and more balanced look than using one size alone.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        },
        "spacer_eG8QX6": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 12
          }
        },
        "subheading_8KrV9d": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Why buy bulk pillar candles from Kisco Candles instead of smaller retail packs?",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-5-base"
          }
        },
        "text_dhePaL": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Buying in bulk makes planning easier when you need matching sizes and colors across an event or venue. It also helps keep the visual finish more consistent and reduces the hassle of piecing together multiple smaller packs from different sources.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        }
      },
